@startuml scenario-SQA-2
!include plantuml-theme.puml
left to right direction
hide stereotype
title Quality attribute scenario — SQA-2 — Security / integrity
rectangle "<b>Source of stimulus</b>\nAttacker who gained code execution in the ui container" as SRC #E7E3F3
rectangle "<b>Stimulus</b>\nAttempts to reach other services' data stores and secrets" as STIM #E7E3F3
rectangle "<b>Artifact</b>\nSecurity groups, task IAM roles and secret scoping" as ART #EDF2F8
rectangle "<b>Response</b>\nOnly the intended call graph is reachable; other stores and secrets are denied" as RESP #E4F0E9
rectangle "<b>Response measure</b>\nProposed — confirm: 0 network paths outside the intended graph (verified by VPC Reachability Analyzer); 0 secrets readable by a non-owning task role" as MEAS #E4F0E9
rectangle "<b>Environment</b>\nNormal operation" as ENV #F5EEE3
SRC  --> STIM : generates
STIM --> ART  : arrives at
ART  --> RESP : produces
RESP --> MEAS : measured by
ENV  ..> ART
@enduml
